    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Muni\u2019s life is hard. She spends her days at a boring job, occasionally thinking about her school friend Terra, and returns to her unloved husband at night. Things get worse when the boss starts to take it out on her for any reason, and her best employee is transferred to another department. Tayo, a new worker in the caf\u00e9 that Muni often visits, adds problems. This catgirl is insufferable, but behind her hyperactive nature, there is an incredible ability to make friends with anyone. Muni will have to make many difficult choices and get to know herself from the most unexpected sides in her new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual Novel, ADV, romance, yuri, drama, comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">three love interests; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multiple endings;  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">romantic and erotic scenes.</p></li></ul>",
